    {
      "id": "claim_064c19d3db684eacae45dc025d29d26d",
      "statement": "The command accepts one or more file or directory paths as arguments, processes them in the order given, and recursively emits each file's contents preceded by its path in a default format of path, --- line, contents, blank line, ---.",
