      "id": "claim_3e7aaf573abe4036b03dc4777737e35e",
      "statement": "Paths can also be supplied on stdin and are combined with argument paths; stdin is split on whitespace by default and on NUL with --null/-0 so filenames containing spaces are supported, and no stdin reading happens when stdin is a TTY.",
