      "id": "claim_84694ae0f00e41128ba3a7b91dee9b1b",
      "statement": ".gitignore rules are honored by default: rules from the parent directory of each top-level path and from nested .gitignore files encountered during the walk are applied, and --ignore-gitignore disables this behavior.",
